---
sub-resources
~ sub_resource BoxShape3D_a (BoxShape3D)
    size.x: 1 → 2
    size.z: 1 → 2
+ sub_resource SphereShape3D_s (SphereShape3D)
- sub_resource StandardMaterial3D_m (StandardMaterial3D)
~ Crate
    + gravity_scale = 0.5
~ Mesh
